OL,3,AFlydubai attacker began a 'drift
OL,4,Atowards extremism and terrorism' in
OL,5,AAustralia, UAE says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Omani co-pilot who allegedly
OL,8,Fattempted to hijack a Flydubai plane
OL,9,Fstarted a "drift towards extremism and
OL,10,Fterrorism" while studying in Australia,
OL,11,FUnited Arab Emirates officials say.
OL,13,FUAE Attorney-General Hamad Saif
OL,14,Fal-Shamsi also alleged the pilot -
OL,15,Fwidely named as Hamam al-Hammami - was
OL,16,Flast week trying to crash the plane
OL,17,Finto Tel Aviv's airport in a "suicide
OL,18,Fattack".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
