OL,3,AFlydubai attacker began a 'drift
OL,4,Atowards extremism and terrorism' in
OL,5,AAustralia, UAE says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe wounded the captain in the cockpit
OL,8,Fwith the emergency crash axe before
OL,9,Fbeing overpowered by passengers.
OL,10,FAnother crew on the Dubai-Tel Aviv
OL,11,Fflight was able to land the aircraft in
OL,12,FSaudi Arabia.
OL,14,FMelbourne university RMIT earlier
OL,15,Fconfirmed the pilot had studied there
OL,16,Fbut left before completing his
OL,17,Fengineering qualification.
